{"id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment.md","title":"Arithmetic syntax and numeric environments","display":"df-arithmetic-formula-environment — Arithmetic syntax and numeric environments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment"],"display":"df-arithmetic-formula-environment — Arithmetic syntax and numeric environments","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; explicit local syntax implementation","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-formula-environment — Arithmetic syntax and numeric environments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; explicit local syntax implementation"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元语言中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j,n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 为有序对。以下各带标签构造子产生有限语法树，不作额外等式商；对象语言构造子带下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\">\\(t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(i)\">\\(\\eta(i)\\)</span> 是变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 的数值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta}\\)</span>、环境更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\">\\(\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\\)</span>、自由变量指标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_t,\\operatorname{fv}_a\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_t,\\operatorname{fv}_a\\)</span> 以及闭句集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\)</span> 在下式中引入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,\\cdot\">\\(0,1,+,\\cdot\\)</span> 在项求值等式右侧为标准自然数与算术运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf S(t)\\coloneqq\\langle2,t\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{add}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{mul}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf S(t)\\coloneqq\\langle2,t\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{add}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{mul}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_a\\coloneqq\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\land_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\lor_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle9,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_a\\coloneqq\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\land_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\lor_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle9,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle10,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\exists_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle11,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle10,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\exists_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle11,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf S(t):t\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{add}(t,s),\\mathsf{mul}(t,s):t,s\\in T_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf S(t):t\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{add}(t,s),\\mathsf{mul}(t,s):t,s\\in T_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\qquad\nG_{n+1}\\coloneqq G_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\lor_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in G_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\;A\\in G_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\qquad\nG_{n+1}\\coloneqq G_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\lor_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in G_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\;A\\in G_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_t(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_t(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\bot_a)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}\\;\\operatorname{fv}_a(A\\circ B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_a(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\bot_a)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}\\;\\operatorname{fv}_a(A\\circ B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\forall_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\exists_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\forall_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\exists_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_a A\\coloneqq A\\to_a\\bot_a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(x_i)\\coloneqq\\eta(i),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_a A\\coloneqq A\\to_a\\bot_a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(x_i)\\coloneqq\\eta(i),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)\\cdot\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)\\cdot\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta[i\\mapsto m](j)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}m,&amp;j=i,\\\\\\eta(j),&amp;j\\ne i.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta[i\\mapsto m](j)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}m,&amp;j=i,\\\\\\eta(j),&amp;j\\ne i.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(x_j,i,n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\overline n,&amp;j=i,\\\\x_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathbf0,i,n)&amp;:=\\mathbf0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf S(t),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf S(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf{add}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf{mul}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(x_j,i,n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\overline n,&amp;j=i,\\\\x_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathbf0,i,n)&amp;:=\\mathbf0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf S(t),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf S(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf{add}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s),i,n)&amp;:=\\mathsf{mul}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(t=_a s,i,n)&amp;:=(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)=_a\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(\\bot_a,i,n)&amp;:=\\bot_a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A\\circ B,i,n)&amp;:=\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n)\\circ\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(B,i,n)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(Q_a x_j A,i,n)&amp;:=\n\\begin{cases}Q_a x_j A,&amp;j=i,\\\\Q_a x_j\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n),&amp;j\\ne i\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Q_a\\in\\{\\forall_a,\\exists_a\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(t=_a s,i,n)&amp;:=(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)=_a\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(\\bot_a,i,n)&amp;:=\\bot_a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A\\circ B,i,n)&amp;:=\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n)\\circ\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(B,i,n)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(Q_a x_j A,i,n)&amp;:=\n\\begin{cases}Q_a x_j A,&amp;j=i,\\\\Q_a x_j\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n),&amp;j\\ne i\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Q_a\\in\\{\\forall_a,\\exists_a\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处明确给出第 VI 章数实现性所需的最小一阶算术语法和标准数值环境。自由构造子表示有限带标签树，故不同构造子不混淆，每棵树都有唯一的顶层分解。阶段并与结构递归保证项、公式和求值良定义。只引入元语言中的标准自然数求值；没有把实数、真类或证明代码当作项值。原书的算术语言可含更多原始递归函数符号；本原子选择足够说明原始七种实现性子句的较小语言，不宣称覆盖其全部扩展符号。</p>\n<p>第二轮补出封闭数码的项与公式代入递归 <code>SubNum_t(t,i,n)</code>、<code>SubNum_a(A,i,n)</code>。代入数码没有自由变量，因此只需在同名量词处停止，不会捕获变量。各式严格递归到子项或子公式，所有分支覆盖且互斥。这供第 VII 章模态公式算术实现的数码代入调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,j,n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta(i)","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[i\\mapsto m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_t,\\operatorname{fv}_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_A","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,+,\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf S(t)\\coloneqq\\langle2,t\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{add}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{mul}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\langle t,s\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_a\\coloneqq\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\land_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\lor_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_a B)\\coloneqq\\langle9,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle10,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\exists_a x_i A\\coloneqq\\langle11,\\langle i,A\\rangle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"T_0\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf S(t):t\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf{add}(t,s),\\mathsf{mul}(t,s):t,s\\in T_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.","display":true},{"tex":"G_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\qquad\nG_{n+1}\\coloneqq G_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\lor_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in G_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\;A\\in G_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_a\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_t(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_a(t=_a s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_t(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\bot_a)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}\\;\\operatorname{fv}_a(A\\circ B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\forall_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\exists_a x_i A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_a A\\coloneqq A\\to_a\\bot_a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(x_i)\\coloneqq\\eta(i),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf S(t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{add}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)+\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)\\cdot\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta[i\\mapsto m](j)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}m,&j=i,\\\\\\eta(j),&j\\ne i.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(x_j,i,n)&:=\\begin{cases}\\overline n,&j=i,\\\\x_j,&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}&\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathbf0,i,n)&:=\\mathbf0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf S(t),i,n)&:=\\mathsf S(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{add}(t,s),i,n)&:=\\mathsf{add}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(\\mathsf{mul}(t,s),i,n)&:=\\mathsf{mul}(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n),\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(t=_a s,i,n)&:=(\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(t,i,n)=_a\\operatorname{SubNum}_t(s,i,n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(\\bot_a,i,n)&:=\\bot_a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A\\circ B,i,n)&:=\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n)\\circ\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(B,i,n)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(Q_a x_j A,i,n)&:=\n\\begin{cases}Q_a x_j A,&j=i,\\\\Q_a x_j\\operatorname{SubNum}_a(A,i,n),&j\\ne i\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Q_a\\in\\{\\forall_a,\\exists_a\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6116,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c7ce8536d0e2df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\operatorname{Sent}_A$、数码、环境和 $\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，标准解释关系 $\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。"},{"id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的 $\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta$、各公式构造子及环境更新。"},{"id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的 $\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]$；$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$n,m,k,i\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"604f716378c63109","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数学对象语法取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，类型取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$i\\in\\omega$。$\\mathcal M_a$ 是下式给出的无析取算术片段，$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$；$\\operatorname{rt}$ 按公式树递归。"},{"id":"bb78d8a03236bc57","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的项集 $\\mathcal T_a$、公式集 $\\mathcal A_a$ 和自由构造子；$n,i\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"117d071027580882","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-arithmetic-formula